  "why": "Two denials about different values are compatible evidence (the employer is neither). Candidates are identified by their content, so not_value(acme) and not_value(globex) are two different candidates, each carrying its value; neither collapses to a bare 'false', and no positive value candidate appears. The kernel status is established_false or unresolved depending on how several negative candidates are summarised, which the design does not fix.",
